      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The Protection of Lawful Commerce in Arms Act (PLCAA) bars certain lawsuits against manufacturers and sellers of frearms."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1141",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "3bf648c8d88b1204f354168f13ac94f67f750f69238f07786c7992e063eb7a66",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bf648c8d88b-0000-0003",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Argued March 4, 2025\u2014Decided June 5, 2025"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mexico",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1141",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "3bf648c8d88b1204f354168f13ac94f67f750f69238f07786c7992e063eb7a66",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bf648c8d88b-0001-0000",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 11,
        "start": 11
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Second, Mexico claims that the manufacturers have failed to impose the kind of controls on their distribution networks that would prevent illegal sales to Mexican traffckers."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Respondent",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1141",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "3bf648c8d88b1204f354168f13ac94f67f750f69238f07786c7992e063eb7a66",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bf648c8d88b-0001-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 11,
        "start": 11
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Brief for Respondent 32. For example, they could prohibit dealers from making \u201cbulk sales\u201d to individual customers, because guns sold in that way (Mexico says) are likely to be \u201cdiverted to the illegal market.\u201d"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1141",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "3bf648c8d88b1204f354168f13ac94f67f750f69238f07786c7992e063eb7a66",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bf648c8d88b-0001-0004",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 11,
        "start": 11
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Yet the manufacturers continue to supply those dealers, as they do legitimate ones, in order to boost their own profts."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Defendant manufacturers",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1141",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "3bf648c8d88b1204f354168f13ac94f67f750f69238f07786c7992e063eb7a66",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bf648c8d88b-0001-0002",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 12,
        "start": 12
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The defendant manufacturers moved to dismiss Mexico's complaint, contending that PLCAA barred the suit."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1141",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "3bf648c8d88b1204f354168f13ac94f67f750f69238f07786c7992e063eb7a66",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bf648c8d88b-0001-0003",
      "kind": "holding",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 13,
        "start": 13
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "We need not address the proximate cause question, because we fnd that Mexico has not plausibly alleged aiding and abetting on the manufacturers' part."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "scotus-23-1141",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "3bf648c8d88b1204f354168f13ac94f67f750f69238f07786c7992e063eb7a66",
      "evidence_id": "ev-3bf648c8d88b-0001-0005",
      "kind": "holding",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 20,
        "start": 20
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "All of that means PLCAA prevents Mexico's suit from going forward."
    }
  ],
  "schema_version": "1.0.0"
}
